<p>You literally dance around your foes, increasing your movement speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 4%, 6%, 8%, 10%</acronym> and reducing the cooldown of Hack'n'Back, Rush, Disengage and Evasion by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns.</p>